# Paths excluded from the trufflehog secret scan.
#
# These are Go regexes matched against the FULL path trufflehog sees, which inside the
# hook container is /src/... — so patterns are deliberately unanchored fragments rather
# than ^-anchored repo-relative paths.
#
# Build outputs, caches and vendored dependencies only. Never application source.
node_modules/
\.mypy_cache/
\.ruff_cache/
\.pytest_cache/
\.git/
\.venv/
/data/
/dist/
/coverage/
/htmlcov/
package-lock\.json$
